{:edb/db-before-t 2675 :edb/db-after-t 2676 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535988 50 #inst "2026-10-09T12:21:29.065Z" 13194139535988 true] [17592186124508 1020 #edb/ref 17592186378389 13194139535988 true] [17592186124508 1020 #edb/ref 17592186378396 13194139535988 true] [17592186124509 1020 #edb/ref 17592186378368 13194139535988 true] [17592186124509 1020 #edb/ref 17592186378375 13194139535988 true] [17592186124509 1020 #edb/ref 17592186378382 13194139535988 true] [17592186378368 1017 #edb/ref 17592186378369 13194139535988 true] [17592186378368 1089 "q-164397" 13194139535988 true] [17592186378368 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535988 true] [17592186378368 1100 "What is the trace in the $yz$-plane of the hyperbolic cylinder $\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{7}=1?$" 13194139535988 true] [17592186378368 1113 #uuid "3f4340be-3d04-5c7c-97ac-086f5051ce04" 13194139535988 true] [17592186378368 1145 "To find the trace in the $yz$-plane, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the cylinder, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(0-4)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{7} & =1 \\\\ 8-\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{7} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{7} & =7 \\\\ (y+1)^{2} & =49 \\\\ y+1 & =\\pm 7 \\\\ y & =-1\\pm 7 \\\\ y & =-8,6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of two lines $y=-8$ and $y=6$ in the $yz$-plane." 13194139535988 true] [17592186378369 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378370 13194139535988 true] [17592186378369 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378371 13194139535988 true] [17592186378369 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378372 13194139535988 true] [17592186378369 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378373 13194139535988 true] [17592186378369 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378374 13194139535988 true] [17592186378369 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535988 true] [17592186378369 1041 "selection" 13194139535988 true] [17592186378369 1104 #edb/ref 17592186378374 13194139535988 true] [17592186378369 1110 #uuid "231f7164-5abe-5747-bdc3-dfacad93349e" 13194139535988 true] [17592186378370 1034 "The line $y=6$" 13194139535988 tr